on-arrival: government_burden_health_market_seen = 1; news_headline = "KO and the centre test a private-health settlement"

= One waiting list, two ideas of health care

Health Minister **[+ health_minister +]** of **[+ health_minister_party +]**
puts the hospital queues on the cabinet screen. KO's economic wing answers
with tax relief for supplementary insurance and a larger role for private
hospitals. [? if third_way_active: Poland 2050 and PSL ministers sell the plan
as a practical escape valve for the NFZ.?][? if not third_way_active: The
former Third Way parties carry the same argument through separate coalition
channels.?]

For Lewica, the line is not public virtue against private wickedness. It is
who controls the queue and where scarce doctors go. Nurses, county hospitals
and patients unable to buy a second policy need to know whether private beds
will serve the universal system—or teach the comfortably insured how to leave
it.

- @health_public
- @health_overflow
- @health_private

@health_public
title: Fund the nurses and county hospitals before any tax relief
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget. Delivers public health; KO and Poland 2050 register a costly defeat.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Public staffing requires one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; health_capacity += 5; public_sector_support += 4; government_delivery += 4; government_goal_health = 1; ko_relation -= 3; p2050_relation -= 2; government_coalition_dissent += 5; news_headline = "The cabinet reserve goes to public staff and hospitals"

**[+ health_minister +]** leaves the meeting with the cabinet reserve assigned
to staff and public hospitals. Directors can advertise posts rather than buy a
few operations from the clinic across town. KO calls it money without
structural reform; hospital unions know which side made the cheque the price
of staying in government.

- @poland_event_queue: File the health settlement with the events desk

@health_overflow
title: Rent private capacity—but make the NFZ set the price
subtitle: Queues shorten under a public ceiling; no Left goal is delivered and the system line blurs.
on-arrival: health_capacity += 2; government_delivery += 2; public_trust += 1; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 2; coalition_blur += 1; news_headline = "Private overflow contracts receive a public-price ceiling"

The NFZ will set the price, volume and expiry of every overflow contract.
Patients gain some earlier operations and the coalition gains a compromise it
can announce. Public hospitals gain no staff, however, and Lewica cannot count
rented capacity as rebuilding the service. The queue is shorter; the argument
over who should own its beds merely moves to the next budget.

- @poland_event_queue: File the health settlement with the events desk

@health_private
title: Let supplementary insurance buy its own queue
subtitle: The coalition relaxes; Lewica accepts a breach that no later delivery can erase.
on-arrival: fiscal_stress -= 2; health_capacity -= 2; public_sector_support -= 5; workers_support -= 3; labor_credibility -= 4; public_trust -= 6; left_poll -= 0.7; left_poll_momentum -= 0.35; urban_progressive_support -= 4; labor_dissent += 4; progressives_dissent += 5; ko_relation += 4; p2050_relation += 3; government_coalition_dissent -= 5; coalition_blur += 6; government_burden_breached = 1; news_headline = "The coalition opens a tax-supported private health lane"

The tax system will now help better-paid households buy a second queue. KO and
Poland 2050 leave the council relieved; ward nurses leave with a different
headline: if you can pay more, you wait less. Public hospitals lose staff and
political oxygen to the subsidised lane.

Lewica's ministers may win something elsewhere, but at the six-month review
they will be confronted as the people who legalised the health exit ramp and
called it coalition realism.

- @poland_event_queue: File the health settlement with the events desk

